          // <strong>CLINICAL PROFILE MATCH:</strong> For oily and acne-prone skin, our 10% Niacinamide PC and Zinc PCA matrix downregulates sebaceous lipogenesis without stripping essential ceramides. Zero comedogenic risk rated. //
