          </div>
        </div>
        <button type="button" class="id__open-btn" data-open-ing>[ DECODE MOLECULAR PROFILE &rarr; ]</button>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 4 -->
      <div class="id__card" data-cat="anti" data-title="Encapsulated Hydroxypinacolone Retinoate" data-inci="INCI: HYDROXYPINACOLONE RETINOATE (HPR)" data-weight="386.57 G/MOL (DIRECT RETINOID)" data-ewg="EWG GREEN RATING: 2 (SAFE ADVANCED)" data-desc="An advanced cosmetic ester of all-trans retinoic acid. Binds directly to retinoid receptors without requiring enzymatic conversion, delivering prescription-strength cellular turnover without erythema or flaking." data-trial="[ 60-DAY CLINICAL ASSAY ]: 41% reduction in wrinkle depth and zero reported instances of retinoid dermatitis.">
        <div class="id__card-top">
          <span class="id__inci-tag">[ 2% GRANACTIVE ESTER ]</span>
          <span class="id__ewg-tag">[ EWG: 2 ]</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="id__ing-title">Granactive Retinoid 2%</h3>
          <span class="id__ing-sub">// INCI: HPR RETINOATE //</span>
          <p class="id__ing-desc">Binds directly to cellular retinoic acid receptors to accelerate epidermal turnover and fade hyperpigmentation without the typical peeling or inflammation.</p>
          <div class="id__trial-box">
            <strong>[ DERMATOLOGICAL TRIAL DATA ]</strong>
