          </div>
        </div>
        <button type="button" class="id__open-btn" data-open-ing>[ DECODE MOLECULAR PROFILE &rarr; ]</button>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 5 -->
      <div class="id__card" data-cat="barrier" data-title="Biomimetic Ceramide NP/AP/EOP Matrix" data-inci="INCI: CERAMIDE NP, CERAMIDE AP, CERAMIDE EOP, CHOLESTEROL" data-weight="650.08 G/MOL (IDENTICAL TO LIPIDS)" data-ewg="EWG GREEN RATING: 1 (NON-TOXIC)" data-desc="Formulated in the exact 3:1:1 physiological ratio of ceramides, cholesterol, and free fatty acids found naturally in healthy human skin bilayers. Instantly repairs stripped or over-exfoliated barriers." data-trial="[ 2-HOUR RECOVERY TEST ]: -64% reduction in transepidermal water loss (TEWL) after surfactant stripping.">
        <div class="id__card-top">
          <span class="id__inci-tag">[ 3:1:1 LIPID RATIO ]</span>
          <span class="id__ewg-tag">[ EWG: 1 ]</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="id__ing-title">Biomimetic Ceramide Tri-Matrix</h3>
          <span class="id__ing-sub">// INCI: CERAMIDE NP / AP / EOP //</span>
          <p class="id__ing-desc">Reconstructs damaged intercellular lamellar sheets, halts transepidermal water loss, and restores biological protection against environmental pollutants.</p>
          <div class="id__trial-box">
            <strong>[ DERMATOLOGICAL TRIAL DATA ]</strong>
            -64% reduction in transepidermal water loss (TEWL) within 2 hours of application.
          </div>
        </div>
        <button type="button" class="id__open-btn" data-open-ing>[ DECODE MOLECULAR PROFILE &rarr; ]</button>
